.Dd February 11, 2026
.Dt VOP_STRATEGY 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vop_strategy
.Nd dispatch a buffer strategy I/O request
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/param.h
.In vfs/vnode.h
.Ft int
.Fn vop_strategy "struct vnode *vp" "void *bp"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn vop_strategy
submits a prepared buffer operation to a filesystem or device strategy
callback.
It is typically used by the buffer cache to execute block reads/writes.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 0 on success, or an error number.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width "[EOPNOTSUPP]"
.It Bq Er EINVAL
.Fa bp
is NULL.
.It Bq Er EOPNOTSUPP
No strategy callback is available.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vnode 9 ,
.Xr vop_bmap 9
